# HD2

Spiritual successor to Hyper Dash. Quest-only. Solo vertical slice. Do not copy Hyper Dash assets, code, names, or proprietary implementations.

## Priorities (in order)

1. Starting pistol feel (fire rate, recovery, recoil, tracking while moving, audio punch)
2. Movement feel (dash, sprint, walk, rail grind)
3. One parallel-track Payload race map
4. Everything else is secondary (graphics, other weapons, cosmetics, progression)

## How to work

- Prefer Unity + latest Meta XR SDK / OpenXR. Keep the project simple and Quest-friendly.
- Prioritize feel and iteration speed over architecture purity early on.
- Suggest small, testable steps. Do not build systems for features that are not needed yet.
- Ask when design intent is ambiguous.
- Flag legal/IP risk if work drifts toward original branding or unique assets.
